Accenture Digital Core

At Accenture Digital Core, we help clients innovate continuously, at speed and scale, combining deep industry expertise with cutting-edge technology to deliver real transformation. You'll join projects where innovation, intelligence and technical experience come together to build robust, secure and scalable digital solutions.

What You'll Do

Design, develop and maintain full stack web applications using React on the frontend, .NET Core / .NET Framework on the backend, and SQL Server as the data layer;

Build and consume RESTful APIs across enterprise platforms;

Integrate CI/CD pipelines and participate in production releases using Azure DevOps and Git;

Troubleshoot and resolve production incidents (P1/P2) with a structured approach to incident and problem management;

Ensure code quality, performance and security standards, including authentication flows;

Collaborate with cross-functional and international teams in an Agile delivery context.

What You'll Need

University degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Information Technology or a comparable technical field;

5–8 years of experience as a Full Stack Developer in production environments;

Strong knowledge of .NET (C#) and related frameworks;

Frontend development experience with React;

Solid command of SQL and ORM tools (Entity Framework);

Professional English (C1, spoken and written); French or Dutch is a plus;

Ability to communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders;

Proactive mindset with a strong sense of ownership and accountability;

Ability to prioritize and manage workload efficiently in a dynamic environment.

